sequenceDiagram
    actor Guest as Guest User
    participant Portal as Hybrid Portal
    participant Livewire as Livewire Component
    participant Service as HelpdeskService
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant Queue as Redis Queue
    participant Mail as Email System
    participant Token as TokenService
    
    Note over Guest,Token: Guest Helpdesk Ticket Submission Flow
    
    Guest->>Portal: Access /helpdesk/create
    Portal->>Livewire: Load TicketForm component
    Livewire->>Guest: Display form (manual input)
    Note over Guest: No Auth::check()<br/>Manual entry required
    
    Guest->>Livewire: Fill form + reCAPTCHA
    Livewire->>Livewire: Client-side validation
    Guest->>Livewire: Submit form
    
    Livewire->>Service: createTicket(data)
    Service->>Service: Generate ticket number<br/>HD-YYYYMM-XXXX
    Service->>Token: generateStatusToken()
    Token-->>Service: SHA-512 hashed token
    Service->>DB: INSERT helpdesk_tickets<br/>user_id = NULL<br/>guest_* fields populated
    DB-->>Service: Ticket created
    
    Service->>Queue: Dispatch SendTicketNotification
    Queue->>Mail: Send confirmation email<br/>with status token link
    Mail-->>Guest: Email received
    
    Service-->>Livewire: Success response
    Livewire-->>Guest: Redirect to success page<br/>Display ticket number + token link
    
    Note over Guest,Token: Status Checking Flow
    
    Guest->>Portal: Click status token link
    Portal->>Service: checkStatus(token)
    Service->>DB: Query by status_token_hash
    DB-->>Service: Ticket details
    Service-->>Portal: Ticket status + timeline
    Portal-->>Guest: Display status page
